. Since then, he has directed the films Manglehorn, Our Brand Is Crisis, Stronger, and episodes of the television comedy-drama Red Oaks, on which he also serves as executive producer. He directed the eleventh, twelfth and thirteenth installments in the Halloween franchise, which he co-wrote with frequent collaborator Danny McBride.","biography_language":"en","biography_source":"tmdb","birthday":"1975-04-09","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oeD9rnfk7AohNiJTRoCx4SOKhXj.jpg","role":"Regia","title":"Maximum Pleasure Guaranteed","tmdb_id":285404,"type":"tv","year":2026},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6h8JXG3ffxb1l1DutYxyOAOuBhb.jpg","role":"Regia","title":"Scarpetta","tmdb_id":240740,"type":"tv","year":2026},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6XCbqv7t0rYE2U1jzjh52fBxczj.jpg","role":"Regia","title":"The Hawk","tmdb_id":254528,"type":"tv","year":2026},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pUViDhfdsEKElPNl5NlafX9ez62.jpg","role":"Regia","title":"L'esorcista - Il credente","tmdb_id":807172,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Brad","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rWOZ9DVtdbRMgEq3XAnSerUnGiq.jpg","role":"","title":"Bones and All","tmdb_id":791177,"type":"movie","year":2022},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/osF0jF1ewL4F8994t4qz83kzmny.jpg","role":"Regia","title":"Halloween Ends","tmdb_id":616820,"type":"movie","year":2022},{"character":"Director","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rpqSvB8n77cpA4LEXcgpTb3ixHY.jpg","role":"","title":"Il talento di Mr. C","tmdb_id":648579,"type":"movie","year":2022},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4Goym9Pf1HXiqAAXTLFFAekEkKo.jpg","role":"Sceneggiatura","title":"Halloween Kills","tmdb_id":610253,"type":"movie","year":2021},{"character":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wThMl6AhneaNw78XHC7fupBxNle.jpg","role":"Regia","